<Layout
  title="The search for JouleOS"
  description="About: the search for JouleOS. The fifth OpenIE research study. One intent stream, lowered onto the coordinate it measured. WebAssembly is a binary instruction format for a stack-based virtual machine. The WebAssembly runtime is the operating system that is seen."
>
  <section class="px-6 md:px-10 pt-16 md:pt-24 pb-20 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
    <p class="section-label mb-4">Fifth study · about</p>
    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-brand-white tracking-tight">
      The search for JouleOS
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-6 font-body text-base text-brand-slate leading-relaxed">
      Existing compute fabric treats the floor as fixed. Kernels, builds, guests, and instruction contracts are collapsed into one rung. Agents are wrapped on top of that settlement. Energy to run is not the condition of a commit. Secure compute requires one law, one meter, and one refusal.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-4 font-body text-base text-brand-slate leading-relaxed">
      WebAssembly is a binary instruction format for a stack-based virtual machine. The WebAssembly runtime is the operating system that is seen. A virtual machine and a container are coordinates.
      The bare-metal kernel is where the law is native. It is not a second product.
      Energy to run is the only true metric of computer intelligence.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-4 font-body text-sm text-brand-gray leading-relaxed">
      Spell Check is Global is the economic opinion beside the studies. It is not this study.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-8 glass-card p-6 space-y-2">
      <p class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[2px] uppercase text-brand-gray">Companion laws</p>
      <p class="font-body text-sm text-brand-slate leading-relaxed">
        <a href="/papers/mol/" class="text-brand-cyan">Mixture of Limits</a> navigates.
        <a href="/papers/ni/" class="text-brand-cyan">Notational Intelligence</a> owns the commit.
        <a href="/papers/satiation/" class="text-brand-cyan">Satiation</a> owns the stop.
        <a href="/papers/mei/" class="text-brand-cyan">Metabolic Intelligence</a> owns the energy envelope.
        <a href="/papers/spellcheck/" class="text-brand-cyan">Spell Check is Global</a> is the economic opinion.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
      <a href="/papers/jouleos/" class="inline-flex font-mono text-xs text-brand-dark bg-brand-amber px-4 py-2.5 rounded-md no-underline hover:bg-brand-gold transition-colors">
        Read paper
      </a>
      <a href="/" class="inline-flex font-mono text-xs text-brand-slate border border-brand-border px-4 py-2.5 rounded-md no-underline hover:text-brand-white transition-colors">
        Catalog
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
